req('SQL-01','Creator ownership, schema/object grants and RLS','platform_integration_owner','One reviewed Prisma SQL history plus separately fingerprinted environment role prerequisite','All app/platform tables owned by wa_schema_owner NOLOGIN/NOBYPASSRLS; ENABLE+FORCE RLS. No schema USAGE/CREATE or object/table/sequence/function grants to anon/authenticated/service_role for internal objects. No TRUNCATE/REFERENCES/TRIGGER/MAINTAIN/CREATE/SET ROLE to application/worker. All actual application DDL must SET ROLE wa_schema_owner; migration ledger exception is private and migrator-owned. Global function default PUBLIC EXECUTE revoked for new application creator roles; no broad changes to provider roles/defaults. Inventory all roles capable of SET ROLE/inheriting the owner. Reject catalog owner/default-ACL drift.','Exact runtime/worker positive action passes its registered policy; migrator installs without giving runtime ownership','Anonymous/authenticated/service-role direct app/platform CRUD denied; runtime TRUNCATE/DDL/SET ROLE denied')
